<ul class="primary">
    <li>Protection Code is a code used in some emergency cases to log in into your account.</li>
    <li>
        Once your account is logged in by the protection code, it will only show the following functions
        <ul class="secondary">
            <li>Win Loss Detail Report</li>
            <li>Win Loss By Product Report</li>
            <li>Commission By Bet Type Report</li>
            <li>Result Report</li>
            <li>Normal Announcement</li>
            <li>Special Announcement</li>
            <li>System Announcement</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Once your account is logged in by the protection code, password CANNOT be used to log in anymore.</p>
        <p>Your account is changed to the "Protection Mode" and only your upline or Customer Service can change it back to normal again.</p>
    </li>
</ul>
